        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-PAGETURNER-FORMAL-THEOREMS-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-THEOREMS-PROOFS-STATE.
            05  WS-THEOREM1-ISOMETRY-VALID     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-THEOREM2-DISP-BOUND-VALID   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-THEOREM3-TWIN-INJECT-VALID  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-THEOREM4-RULE18-CSUM-VALID  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-THEOREM5-TPA-BOUND-VALID    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-GRAND-SYNTHESIS-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-THEOREMS.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-THEOREMS.
            IF WS-THEOREM1-ISOMETRY-VALID = 1 AND
               WS-THEOREM2-DISP-BOUND-VALID = 1 AND
               WS-THEOREM3-TWIN-INJECT-VALID = 1 AND
               WS-THEOREM4-RULE18-CSUM-VALID = 1 AND
               WS-THEOREM5-TPA-BOUND-VALID = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-GRAND-SYNTHESIS-CODE
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-GRAND-SYNTHESIS-CODE.
